title: Bandit Toll
portrait left: seeker
portrait right: bandit

bandit: Toll road. Forty gold, or we take it out of your notes.

choice:
  - [if gold >= 40] Pay 40 gold -> pay
  - Fight -> fight
  - Hand over a card -> card

@pay
  > gold -40
  bandit: Pleasure. Mind the beetles.
  > end

@fight
  > fight bandit-scribe,bandit-scribe
  bandit: ...fine. Road's yours.
  > end

@card
  > card remove choose 1
  bandit: Can't even read it. Off you go.
  > end
